        <item>
            <title>2.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:14:43 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew</link>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>German localization of the app, the menu bar app, the administrator password prompt and Sparkle's update window; Bromehew follows the system language ([#2](https://github.com/appnoe/bromehew/issues/2)).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The menu bar icon shows the state in colour: a green mug when everything is up to date, a red mug with the number of updates, an orange mug with “!” when something needs attention. Before the first check it keeps the menu bar's own colour ([#4](https://github.com/appnoe/bromehew/issues/4)).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew/releases/download/v2.2.0/Bromehew-2.2.0.dmg" length="4506655" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="BV84o7izvTYUkZcRT9uryBOoiR+focN8oIIIqWJMoK+ryD7RFKJ743jM3v1eJPMkVLs1ZH4eHHo8FCz267C+Ag=="/>
        </item>
