            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Open at login could not be switched on: macOS reports a login item that was never registered as “not found”, which disabled the toggle with a wrong hint about the Applications folder.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
